    },
    {
        "text": "]",
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you come all the way out to the boonies to dig up something good for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "For death and destruction, naturally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep running your mouth. Though, as long as I'm on the giving side of death and destruction, I'm alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost here. Do you still remember anything about this place, Ratatos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...If memory serves me right, this road leading out of Kjerag has long been abandoned since the wind and snow took down the bridge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blizzards are frequent, and even reinforced bridges are hard to secure. The people have all but given up on redeveloping the roads here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How many hands do you have at the Turicum pass?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough to let me know who and what Enciodes deals with every day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, do you know how much military equipment and personnel have passed into Kjerag under your nose lately?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you saying that Enciodes bypassed Turicum and opened a railway out in a place like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's ludicrous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, it's coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But that road leads straight down into a canyon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drawbridge",
        "volume": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": ".........",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_bat_essenceofevolution_intro",
        "key": "$m_bat_essenceofevolution_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tools were used to enclose the bridges, tracks, and load-bearing structures into the cliffs on both sides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "To avoid prying eyes and ears, the structure extends from the mountain to form a bridge only when a train is about to pass...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a simple idea, yet incredibly intricate to implement. A pity that I didn't come up with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "backgroundtween",
        "xFrom": 0,
        "yFrom": 20,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": -20,
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1.3,
        "yScaleTo": 1.3,
        "duration": 10,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "The fresh snow on the ground shudders imperceptibly, and a faint sound gradually grows stronger."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The bridge's bearings spring to life with sparks of light, just as the light of civilization shines into Kjerag."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
