    {
        "text": "The burning light suddenly expands, becoming brighter and warmer, engulfing several carriages in the middle of the train like a bonfire on a festival night."
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, unable to swallow what it had engulfed, the flames brutally split the carriage with a deafening roar."
    },
